  unitName: God Phoenix
  unitId: 10114
  unitNumber: 137
  description: A holy bird born from a volcano once every few millennia.They are
    known as the Gods of the rare sacred birds.Their bodies reach several thousand
    degrees when angry, burning enemies to ash. Said to be incarnations of gods because
    of their intelligence and sense of justice, all those who are vanquished by them
    are thought to have received the judgement of the gods.
  summonDesc: My sacred flame<br>exists to destroy evildoers.<br>My strength is your
    shield.
  fusionDesc: I completely accept<br>your passionate spirit.
  evoDesc: My fire remains with those<br>who are virtuous.<br>You are one such person.
